  "description": "*“I'm... I'm a pakuri to my super handsome crush...?!”* \n\nLiking Kanghyun's artwork so much, Jiun became his pakuri(someone who copies another's artwork). One day, Jiun is shocked to be told by a friend that he's just a mere pakuri. Over his distraught guilt, he decides to meet with Kanghyun to apologize. But instead... Jiun becomes Kanghyun's assistant?!",
